; mini-dotnet (docs/plans/done/plan_dotnet.md): a runtime for the
; assemblies Microsoft's C# compiler writes. Its modules in folders:
;   assembly/  the file: Metadata (the 45 tables' shapes), Image (the PE
;              file read: heaps, tables, a method's body), Signature (the
;              blobs' types), Il (the opcodes, a body decoded and
;              encoded), Listing (-tables, -S), Writer (an assembly
;              written: mini-tiger's, mini-csc's)
;   runtime/   what the interpreter and the JIT stand on: Value (the
;              types and values: an object's numbers in bytes, its
;              references apart), Library (System's classes, ix's own:
;              the adapters over lib_core), Types (the loader: classes
;              laid out, vtables, tokens resolved, generics instantiated)
;   interpreter/  Frame (a call's frame, an exception's first pass),
;              Arith (the instructions' numbers), Machine (the IL run)
;   jit/       Verifier (each slot's type: the JIT's input), Jit (its
;              code as text), Jit_run (that code run: mini-asm's parser,
;              mini-ld's encoders), Code_memory (here dune's, no JIT:
;              jit/mini-ml/'s is the mkfile's)
; CLI and Main here; csc/ and tests/ have their own stanzas.
(include_subdirs unqualified)

(library
 (name ix_dotnet)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules :standard \ CLI Main)
 (libraries ix_core ix_asm ix_ld fpath caps))

; the command
(library
 (name ix_dotnet_cli)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules CLI)
 (libraries ix_dotnet ix_core fpath caps))

(executable
 (name Main)
 (public_name mini-dotnet)
 (package ix)
 (modules Main)
 (libraries ix_dotnet_cli ix_core caps))
